when we started working on the PvP mode  for Ghost Recon wildlands we knew we  wanted to create something different a  tense and thrilling game of tactical  team play taking co-op to the next level  today  we are proud to reveal the first Intel  on the free upcoming PvP mode for Ghost  Recon wildlands those were our objective  with ghost war was to build upon the  main games elements of co-op team play  and open tactical gameplay ghost war is  a 4v4 team deathmatch experience for two  teams of highly specialized combatants  fight in wide open environments you can  choose among a variety of classes that  you can upgrade with many different  perks each class has a specific role to  play with its own strengths and  weaknesses you and your team have to  carefully design the best combination of  play styles to take down your opponents  based on locations from the main game  the areas of conflict are wide and open  and offer plenty of opportunities and  threats through mountains deserts the  jungles or forests the terrains weathers  and times of day will push you to adapt  to the situation in ghost war new game  mechanics including a suppression system  and sound markers will deepen the  tactical options available to the player  all of these elements will make team  play communication and strategic skills  more crucial than ever in the middle of  the battleground your choices will have  real consequences should you try to  revive your friend or mark the enemy  sniper will you risk giving away your  position by shooting or lay down a trap  near the Recon antenna and when you're  the last man standing will you have what  it takes to find a way to prevail we  cannot wait for you to be able to try  out the free ghost for PvP mode for  Ghost Recon wildlands check out Ghost  Recon comm for more information on  ghosts war including more intel on the  classes in the coming weeks we're also  beginning a series of beta tests to  balance the game so stay tuned we look  forward to seeing you on the battlefield  lair this summer
 

